    "name": "SmartWMS — Complete API & Advisory AI Collection",
    "description": "End-to-end Postman v2.1 collection for SmartWMS (main baseline after PR #15). Configure {{baseUrl}}, {{username}}, and {{password}} in SmartWMS.local.postman_environment.json; Login automatically captures {{token}}.",
